{
  "job_B11.9.3.1_20251003_114256": {
    "text": "Myn drihten god \u00e6lmihtig, ic \u00fee eom andetta minra synna \u00feara \u00fee ic on minre gemeleste wi\u00fe \u00fee\nMin dryhten god \u00e6lmihtig, ic \u00fee eom andetta bote for mines lichoman unsyfernessum \u00feara \u00fee ic d\u00e6ges\nMin drihten god \u00e6lmihtig, ic eom oferfangen mid synnum to wyrmlice for\u00feon \u00fee ic forgemeleasade \u00feine\nIc eom andetta bote for ealles mines lichoman gecynde & for ealle \u00fea w\u00e6stmas \u00f0e minan synfullan\nNu ic \u00fee bidde, min drihten, for ealra \u00feinra haligra lufan, \u00feeah ic \u00fee \u00feus synful to cige for minum\nMin drihten god, for ealra \u00feinra apostola weor\u00f0unge ic \u00fee halsige \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu me ne forl\u00e6te on \u00fe\u00e6m\nMin drihten god, for minre tyddernesse \u00feeah ic \u00feine bebodu ne heolde.\nNu ic \u00fee \u00feeah halsige, min drihten god, for \u00fe\u00e6re \u00ferowunge \u00fee \u00feu \u00ferowodest for ealra manna h\u00e6lo, & ic\nMin drihten god, for \u00feon \u00feu w\u00e6re in byrgenne geset, ne l\u00e6t me belucan on synfulra monna\nNu ic minum gewyrhtum \u00feus wace truwige for minum synfullum d\u00e6dum.\nMin drihten god \u00e6lmihtig forgif me minra synna liss\u00e6 for minre nyd\u00feearfe.\nMin drihten god \u00e6lmihtig for\u00f0on \u00feu w\u00e6re eadig on \u00f0inre modor inno\u00fee ne forl\u00e6t me.\nMin sanctus Michael archangelus beo \u00feu me \u00feingere to \u00fe\u00e6m heofenlican scyppende to \u00e6lmihtigum gode\nMin drihten god, sele me gedefe hreowe & so\u00fee andetnesse ealra minra synna \u00feara \u00f0e ic on minre\nMin drihten god, ne l\u00e6t me synfulne man deoflum gegan \u00feeah hi me \u00feus synlice costedon for\u00f0on \u00feu on\nMin drihten god, for ealr\u00e6 \u00fe\u00e6re gesceafte \u00fee \u00feu on syx dagum gesceapen h\u00e6fdest & \u00fea \u00feu gerestes on\nMin drihten god, ne l\u00e6t me aslidon on \u00fea synfullan eardungstowe \u00feeah mine gewyrhta \u00feus wace syn for\nNu ic \u00fee bidde, min drihten, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu me selle god ingehyd & gemynd \u00fe\u00e6t ic gelyfe on \u00f0e & on \u00f0a ealle\nMin drihten, ic \u00fee bidde for ealra \u00feinra apostola arwyr\u00fenesse \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0u me ne sceade of \u00fe\u00e6m so\u00fef\u00e6stan \u00f0e\nNu ic halsige \u00fea heofanlican f\u00e6mnan Sanctam Marian, swylce ic Michahel & Gabriel & Raphael,\nNu ic halsige \u00fea cristes \u00feegnas for hiora ealdorlican setle \u00fe\u00e6t ge me synfulne manne sceadon on \u00fea\nPer te Ihesu Xriste saluator mundi qui in trinitate perfecta uiuis et regnas in secula seculorum, Amen.",
